{"Title":"An Act relative to the availability of court interpreters","BillNumber":"H3592","DocketNumber":"HD3066","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"JAG2","Name":"Judith A. Garcia","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JAG2","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T07:58:27.137"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"JAG2","Name":"Judith A. Garcia","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JAG2","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T07:58:27.1366667"},{"Id":"JCD1","Name":"James C. Arena-DeRosa","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JCD1","ResponseDate":"2023-03-17T15:18:44.7366667"},{"Id":"S_M1","Name":"Samantha Montaño","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/S_M1","ResponseDate":"2023-03-21T14:06:45.4"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3592/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Garcia of Chelsea, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3592) of Judith A. Garcia, James C. Arena-DeRosa and Samantha Montaño relative to the availability of court interpreters.  The Judiciary.","DocumentText":"\tSection 2 of chapter 221C, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended by adding the following paragraph:-\r\n\tIf a qualified interpreter or a certified interpreter is not reasonably available leading to a delay in a legal proceeding, a non-English speaker may provide to the court an interpreter to assist them throughout the legal proceeding. An interpreter who is provided by the non-English speaker pursuant to this paragraph shall be approved by the judge and shall be subject to the provisions of sections 4 and 5.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J19","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J19"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}